#: ../../engines.md:1 b048d2a5aade4f3b8ee7b4c3125b383f
msgid "Choosing an engine"
msgstr "選擇引擎"

#: ../../engines.md:3 4d1dbf5f9a024a87ae6c442068a85a4e
msgid ""
"The engine block is part of the *request*, not part of the graph, so "
"changing it costs a price and never a rebuild. Pick the method and the "
"interface shows the parameter block that belongs to it — a field that "
"does not apply cannot be set, rather than being set and dropped."
msgstr "引擎區塊屬於*請求*，不屬於物件圖，因此改動它的代價是一次計價，永遠不是一次重建。挑好方法，介面就顯示屬於它的參數區塊——不適用的欄位無法被設定，而不是設定了再被丟掉。"

#: ../../engines.md 5e08af6d4ae44071874faee6fa8cfb8e
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../engines.md 967b726c38004c52adf9ab0721491bf5
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "參數"

#: ../../engines.md d7cbd7c6fad844b2a37f060b40280c22
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "備註"

#: ../../engines.md e5cf249b77924cdb83519a8228ad0b3f
msgid "**analytic**"
msgstr "**解析解（analytic）**"

#: ../../engines.md f7e7079e4e96484da05848ef8c9cec40
msgid "approximation"
msgstr "近似法"

#: ../../engines.md 6b6b5b910d304cd492b3c85684813c28
msgid "required for an American vanilla"
msgstr "美式一般型必填"

#: ../../engines.md ba015b615c824cebbd797c1e553e07db
msgid "**lattice**"
msgstr "**格點（lattice）**"

#: ../../engines.md 52882324defa4d0abcc8c411c6aadb68
msgid "tree, steps"
msgstr "樹、步數"

#: ../../engines.md 65ee3e168fc04b93bb8109bf8d165514
msgid "both required; steps must be non-zero"
msgstr "兩者皆必填；步數不得為零"

#: ../../engines.md 1490e175f17e431abba368f019ed889b
msgid "**finite difference**"
msgstr "**有限差分（finite difference）**"

#: ../../engines.md ce7c050a16284b0392d5f9bbcb801b14
msgid "preset or custom grid"
msgstr "預設網格或自訂網格"

#: ../../engines.md ba4abc25160744dbbd24d761d4e7a9f3
msgid "see below"
msgstr "見下文"

#: ../../engines.md 064fefe33d4a44ba9d46e820b6834f87
msgid "**Monte Carlo**"
msgstr "**蒙地卡羅（Monte Carlo）**"

#: ../../engines.md 94dd13e248d94739853e1484a59c89a7
msgid "seed, samples, steps/year, progress"
msgstr "亂數種子、樣本數、每年步數、進度"

#: ../../engines.md 7ea4eb05ab16471ebfb2e87fbfa527e9
msgid "seed must be non-zero"
msgstr "亂數種子不得為零"

#: ../../engines.md 913597dca992434a92b06d5f07cb0f7f
msgid "**integral**"
msgstr "**數值積分（integral）**"

#: ../../engines.md 2d3bca1d92fe48fd8ee7f36c1822ce03
#: b2b05de6dcb5429da843f48cefe2f0af
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md 836b2218d0c04b70b4043d8888176ef2
msgid "European vanilla only"
msgstr "僅歐式一般型"

#: ../../engines.md 834ee42d9e9b4e558039e181ecf1f3a5
msgid "**discounting**"
msgstr "**折現（discounting）**"

#: ../../engines.md ba97badb18b74cae847f5f81b59e8ca3
msgid "swaps"
msgstr "利率交換"

#: ../../engines.md:17 4fc5ecc3b7b849cb962a72ac804e4f5e
msgid ""
"Fourier is in the schema; the models it exists for (Heston, Bates) are "
"not built, so it is never offered."
msgstr "傅立葉法存在於結構描述中；它所服務的模型（Heston、Bates）沒有實作，因此從不提供。"

#: ../../engines.md:20 522acf4cfd684c24b956855ca77c3baa
msgid ""
"The engine card with the method picker open and scrolled to its foot, on "
"an American vanilla. Lattice and finite difference are white and "
"selectable; Monte Carlo, Fourier and discounting are greyed out, each "
"with a sentence underneath saying it is not priced by this build and why."
msgstr ""
"引擎卡片，方法選單開著並捲到最下面，交易是一檔美式普通選擇權。lattice 與 finite difference 是白色、可以選；Monte "
"Carlo、Fourier 與 discounting 都是灰的，每一個下面都有一句話說明這個建置不定這個價，以及為什麼。"

#: ../../engines.md:24 6d289f53daab4b2ab5aa5c2141581738
msgid ""
"The foot of the method picker, on an American vanilla. A method this "
"trade cannot take stays in the list and carries its own reason — the two "
"European-only engines say which engine class is the limit, and Fourier "
"says it is not wired up rather than quietly vanishing. What the list "
"offers comes from this client's tables, and the drift check holds those "
"against the service's own list on every run."
msgstr ""
"方法選單的底部，交易是一檔美式普通選擇權。這筆交易不能用的方法仍然留在清單裡，並帶著它自己的理由——兩個只做歐式的引擎會說出是哪個引擎類別擋住了，而"
" Fourier 會說它沒有接上，而不是安靜地消失。清單提供什麼來自這個用戶端自己的表格，而漂移檢查每一次執行都會拿它去對服務自己的清單。"

#: ../../engines.md:32 e36577f6eca042d08350dfde43a00839
msgid "American approximations"
msgstr "美式近似法"

#: ../../engines.md:34 2114af2d3874469099fd5f82e92c0d99
msgid ""
"QuantLib has three closed-form American approximations and **they "
"disagree in the third decimal**, so the client names one rather than "
"inheriting a default. Omitting it is an error on the approximation field,"
" not a silent choice."
msgstr ""
"QuantLib "
"有三種封閉解的美式近似法，而**它們在小數第三位就不一致**，所以由用戶端指名一種，而不是繼承某個預設值。省略它會在近似法欄位上得到錯誤，而不是一個安靜的選擇。"

#: ../../engines.md:20 e681f2414ba744678f0fa4ef0a1e0dfc
msgid "Approximation"
msgstr "近似法"

#: ../../engines.md:20 085aef32ee634070a9e1c696643def5f
msgid "Character"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../engines.md:20 5001adaf03f748f985ed9f6e5a0da0de
msgid "Barone-Adesi-Whaley"
msgstr "Barone-Adesi-Whaley"

#: ../../engines.md:20 eb0da87b06434c91aab750c4719e1595
msgid ""
"The classic quadratic approximation; fast, least accurate near the "
"boundary"
msgstr "經典的二次近似；快，但在邊界附近最不準"

#: ../../engines.md:20 f4966c192dbf4a97a65df9936c39476e
msgid "Bjerksund-Stensland"
msgstr "Bjerksund-Stensland"

#: ../../engines.md:20 190cc56acbbe4d0583f5733ccb9be69b
msgid "Flat-boundary approximation; generally the better of the two originals"
msgstr "平坦邊界近似；一般而言是兩個原始方法中較好的一個"

#: ../../engines.md:20 12b929cf7df14bea9116f6abec4f42ff
msgid "Ju-Zhong quadratic"
msgstr "Ju-Zhong 二次法"

#: ../../engines.md:20 798106b030414082a8bb43188915fd3c
msgid "A correction to the quadratic method, usually closest to a fine lattice"
msgstr "對二次法的修正，通常最接近細格點的結果"

#: ../../engines.md:44 3bd834035b514b3ea97e52db5e206df8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The mathematics is in {doc}`maths/american`. If you need a number you can"
" defend rather than a fast one, price the same trade on a lattice with "
"several thousand steps and compare."
msgstr "數學原理見 {doc}`maths/american`。若你要的是一個站得住腳的數字而不是一個快的數字，就用幾千步的格點為同一筆交易計價再比對。"

#: ../../engines.md:48 ec462d186fd042d28aea35bfd7b27813
msgid ""
"The engine card on an American vanilla with method analytic. The "
"approximation select shows the placeholder \"required\" in red, under a "
"message that an American analytic price needs an explicit approximation "
"because QuantLib has three and they disagree in the third decimal."
msgstr ""
"美式普通選擇權、方法選 analytic 時的引擎卡片。approximation "
"下拉框顯示紅色的佔位字「required」，下面一行訊息說：美式的解析定價需要明確指定近似法，因為 QuantLib "
"有三種，而它們在小數第三位就不一致。"

#: ../../engines.md:52 da20ad56393f49f8855fa48119c26ddb
msgid ""
"Nothing is chosen for you. The field starts empty and says why, rather "
"than defaulting to Barone-Adesi/Whaley and letting a number that could "
"have been one of three arrive looking settled."
msgstr ""
"沒有任何東西替你選。這個欄位一開始就是空的，而且會說明原因，而不是預設用 Barone-"
"Adesi/Whaley，讓一個本來可能是三種之一的數字看起來像是定案。"

#: ../../engines.md:57 263740d65cd54cc4b95123363da825f0
msgid "Lattice trees"
msgstr "格點樹"

#: ../../engines.md:59 94ec5b283c89488c849db64bb2199b6f
msgid ""
"Seven trees compile for a vanilla: Cox-Ross-Rubinstein, Jarrow-Rudd, "
"additive equiprobabilities, Trigeorgis, Tian, Leisen-Reimer and Joshi4. A"
" **barrier takes Cox-Ross-Rubinstein only.**"
msgstr ""
"一般型有七種樹可編譯使用：Cox-Ross-Rubinstein、Jarrow-Rudd、加法等機率、Trigeorgis、Tian"
"、Leisen-Reimer 與 Joshi4。**障礙僅支援 Cox-Ross-Rubinstein。**"

#: ../../engines.md:63 1fbbc7de732a4515a9715552885b17bc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Two of them — Leisen-Reimer and Joshi4 — are strike-aware and force an "
"odd number of steps, which is what makes their convergence smooth rather "
"than oscillating. If you are stepping the step count to watch a price "
"settle, those two settle first. Again, {doc}`maths/american` has the "
"parameterisations."
msgstr ""
"其中兩種——Leisen-Reimer 與 "
"Joshi4——會參考履約價並強制使用奇數步數，這正是它們收斂平滑而不震盪的原因。若你在逐步加大步數觀察價格穩定下來，這兩種最先穩定。同樣地，{doc}`maths/american`"
" 有各自的參數化。"

#: ../../engines.md:68 eae531a690d843b1891ea8d91ae2f7b6
msgid ""
"The engine card with method lattice on a barrier and the tree picker "
"open. Cox-Ross-Rubinstein is white and selectable; Jarrow-Rudd and "
"additive equiprobabilities are greyed out, each saying QuantLib's barrier"
" lattice is Cox-Ross-Rubinstein only, with the Derman-Kani correction."
msgstr ""
"障礙選擇權、方法選 lattice 時的引擎卡片，tree 選單開著。Cox-Ross-Rubinstein 是白色、可以選；Jarrow-"
"Rudd 與 additive equiprobabilities 是灰的，兩個都說 QuantLib 的障礙格點只有 Cox-Ross-"
"Rubinstein，並帶 Derman-Kani 修正。"

#: ../../engines.md:72 eb7178e0685f4b60acb7f9eb636267f1
msgid ""
"The tree picker on a **barrier**, where six of the seven close and all "
"six give the same reason. On a vanilla every one of them is open, and the"
" picker looks like the list above."
msgstr "**障礙選擇權**上的樹選單：七棵裡有六棵關著，而且六棵給的是同一個理由。在普通選擇權上，七棵全部開放，選單看起來就跟上面那張一樣。"

#: ../../engines.md:77 580da84be4314370aafba02d96ab4456
msgid "Finite difference"
msgstr "有限差分"

#: ../../engines.md:79 bc9dab2be57d4ccd886ad0161e7bc02b
msgid "The grid is **time steps × asset steps**:"
msgstr "網格是**時間步數 × 資產步數**："

#: ../../engines.md:68 89bb1ed733644aacb39c39f4561ebce0
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "預設網格"

#: ../../engines.md:68 984da46cc4fd41d9bfa1d81bc7ea7f9b
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "網格"

#: ../../engines.md:68 a515ba0d18174be0ac2c7c8f4be3675d
msgid "coarse"
msgstr "粗（coarse）"

#: ../../engines.md:68 aad048775376497fa17c6dc16f2c84c6
msgid "100 × 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md:68 b140c98d1991404b95860d000ce2e2b2
msgid "standard"
msgstr "標準（standard）"

#: ../../engines.md:68 cb3f6ac2e22d48cbbc027b2665df9400
msgid "400 × 200"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md:68 5251316bb5c0470b93762ffb4b78e8e7
msgid "fine"
msgstr "細（fine）"

#: ../../engines.md:68 e1a5347abb9b47b8a4e097c0c47f1d9c
msgid "2000 × 800"
msgstr ""

#: ../../engines.md:87 4d3007f2d891412e84d33c913e895dae
msgid ""
"A custom grid names both dimensions explicitly, plus the **scheme** and "
"the **damping steps**. None of the four has a default: two grids, or two "
"schemes, are two different prices for the same trade, so a request that "
"leaves one out is refused rather than answered on a choice nobody made. "
"The three presets are Douglas with no damping."
msgstr ""
"自訂網格要明確指定兩個維度，外加**時間離散格式**（scheme）與**阻尼步數**。這四者都沒有預設值：兩組網格、或兩種格式，對同一筆交易就是兩個不同的價格，因此少填一項的請求會被拒絕，而不是拿一個沒人做過的選擇去回答。三個預設網格都是"
" Douglas 且不加阻尼。"

#: ../../engines.md:93 6529414a3403437aa07c07efda0cc597
msgid ""
"The engine card with method finite difference and the grid switch set to "
"explicit rather than preset: time steps 400, asset steps 200, damping "
"steps 20, and a scheme select showing Crank-Nicolson under the note that "
"two schemes are two prices for one trade."
msgstr ""
"方法選 finite difference、格點切換從 preset 改成 explicit 時的引擎卡片：time steps "
"400、asset steps 200、damping steps 20，以及一個顯示 Crank-Nicolson 的 scheme "
"下拉框，上面標著「兩個 scheme 就是同一筆交易的兩個價格」。"

#: ../../engines.md:97 6529414a3403437aa07c07efda0cc597
msgid ""
"The grid switch is preset or explicit, and explicit means all four "
"fields. The damping steps are taken before the 400 rather than out of "
"them, so any number of them is a grid."
msgstr ""
"格點切換不是 preset 就是 explicit，而 explicit 表示四個欄位都要填。阻尼步數是在那 400 "
"步之前另外走的，不是從中扣出，所以不論多少步都是一個有效的網格。"

#: ../../engines.md:102 76d24d8f94934594af40c5ec3bba9850
msgid "The schemes"
msgstr "各種時間離散格式"

#: ../../engines.md:93 3e9dc41802b646fca36609cedcf680fb
msgid "Scheme"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../engines.md:93 b46716de981449f19c3658b29180502c
msgid "What it is here"
msgstr "在這裡是什麼"

#: ../../engines.md:93 02d56be152614b119ad4c20889e7fcab
msgid "Douglas"
msgstr "Douglas"

#: ../../engines.md:93 2d2fc94616d844a4828b872c1ce3aea7
msgid "QuantLib's own default, second order. What to pick with no opinion"
msgstr "QuantLib 自己的預設值，二階。沒有特別意見時就挑它"

#: ../../engines.md:93 2b48fce366fe4a15af72a746ba1a9e1f
msgid "Crank-Nicolson"
msgstr "Crank-Nicolson"

#: ../../engines.md:93 6fc977be13d540cbb6819992b4b16835
msgid "Douglas to within a bit — in one dimension they coincide"
msgstr "與 Douglas 只差一個位元——在一維中兩者重合"

#: ../../engines.md:93 efe34e8428c0483f9f9ffbeacf412b41
msgid "Craig-Sneyd"
msgstr "Craig-Sneyd"

#: ../../engines.md:93 e61865957c4c451d8f546793ecfeadc4
msgid "*Exactly* Douglas here: it alternates directions and there is one"
msgstr "在這裡*完全等於* Douglas：它輪流處理各個方向，而這裡只有一個方向"

#: ../../engines.md:93 392d43bb9d2e4aa381d2b99644c3ed4d
msgid "Hundsdorfer"
msgstr "Hundsdorfer"

#: ../../engines.md:93 528b316edbdd4d4a8720218c7a40133d
msgid "A different weighting; differs from Douglas in the seventh digit"
msgstr "權重不同；與 Douglas 在第七位數字才有差異"

#: ../../engines.md:93 f88f4cd1cdf749359acec4a87434d010
msgid "implicit Euler"
msgstr "隱式 Euler"

#: ../../engines.md:93 0e1bd7b66a3a48ae854ff37a0b264118
msgid "First order, unconditionally stable; differs in the third digit"
msgstr "一階，無條件穩定；在第三位數字就有差異"

#: ../../engines.md:93 bd16f91768cb4b0b98e24e18ea729afe
msgid "explicit Euler"
msgstr "顯式 Euler"

#: ../../engines.md:93 0bdb1c136256496a9a076ea53a200ef8
msgid "Closed — see below"
msgstr "已關閉——見下文"

#: ../../engines.md:113 c3c910c68b784558aee9b84eb9ad2771
msgid ""
"Explicit Euler is refused, and the reason is worth knowing rather than "
"working around: it is stable only while the time step is small against "
"the *square* of the asset step, and the asset step belongs to a grid "
"QuantLib builds inside the engine rather than to anything you can see on "
"this panel. An unstable run does not fail — measured on this build, a "
"half-year vanilla at 100 × 200 came back as 2.4e140 and at 400 × 200 as a"
" NaN. Implicit Euler is first order too, with no such condition."
msgstr ""
"顯式 Euler 被拒絕，而它的理由值得知道，而不是繞過去：它只有在時間步長相對於資產步長的*平方*夠小時才穩定，而資產步長屬於 QuantLib"
" 在引擎內部自行建構的網格，不屬於這個面板上你看得到的任何東西。不穩定的計算不會失敗——在這個版本上實測，半年期一般型在 100 × 200 "
"回來的是 2.4e140，在 400 × 200 回來的是 NaN。隱式 Euler 同樣是一階，卻沒有這個條件。"

#: ../../engines.md:121 b0ea33e71e3d4a24a4a7e2ae994342e5
msgid "Damping steps"
msgstr "阻尼步數"

#: ../../engines.md:123 6529414a3403437aa07c07efda0cc597
msgid ""
"Rannacher damping takes a few fully implicit steps first, which kills the"
" oscillation a Crank-Nicolson-family scheme shows against a kinked payoff"
" or a barrier. They are **added to** the time steps rather than taken out"
" of them — QuantLib runs both — so any number of them is a grid, up to "
"the same limit as the time steps."
msgstr "Rannacher 阻尼先走幾步全隱式，藉此消除 Crank-Nicolson 家族格式在收益函數轉折處或障礙附近出現的震盪。它們是**加在**時間步數之外的，不是從中撥出——QuantLib 兩者都會走——所以任何數量都是有效的網格，上限與時間步數相同。"

#: ../../engines.md:129 3ef73f6db4b1447c9e58d9f30a4d69df
msgid ""
"Reach for them when a price wobbles as you step the grid — particularly "
"on a barrier, and particularly near the barrier."
msgstr "當你調整網格而價格上下擺盪時就該動用它——尤其是障礙商品，尤其是在障礙附近。"

#: ../../engines.md:132 2be308cd42ce4dd0aecfdadaa8521ed0
msgid ""
"Under quanto the grid must be one of the three presets. The wrapper "
"builds its inner engine from a process alone, so each grid is a separate "
"compiled type and an arbitrary pair has nowhere to go. It is refused "
"loudly rather than rounded to the nearest preset."
msgstr ""
"在 quanto "
"之下，網格必須是三個預設之一。包裝器只用一個隨機過程建構內層引擎，因此每一組網格都是一個獨立編譯出來的型別，任意的一對尺寸無處可去。它會被明確拒絕，而不是四捨五入到最接近的預設網格。"

#: ../../engines.md:137 60a6f5d7fbdc4b4c8e201586a45c1a27
msgid "Monte Carlo"
msgstr "蒙地卡羅"

#: ../../engines.md:139 cd348204b5674300a8a738a1e703c0d9
msgid ""
"**The seed must be non-zero.** QuantLib otherwise seeds from the clock, "
"and the same inputs would price differently on every request."
msgstr "**亂數種子不得為零**。否則 QuantLib 會以時鐘取種，同樣的輸入在每次請求都會算出不同的價格。"

#: ../../engines.md:141 c5c402dd5a9e443ba9f04eee0722373b
msgid ""
"Give **samples**; this build requires a positive sample count and does "
"not serve the absolute-tolerance form the schema carries."
msgstr "請給**樣本數**；這個版本要求正的樣本數，並未提供結構描述中另一種以絕對誤差為準的形式。"

#: ../../engines.md:143 29963065a2a94593aaa65f429dba8147
msgid ""
"**Steps per year** matters for anything path-dependent (a barrier, an "
"Asian, a cliquet); a European payoff only needs the terminal value, and "
"leaving it at zero gives it one step to expiry."
msgstr "**每年步數**對任何路徑相依的商品都重要（障礙、亞式、棘輪式）；歐式收益函數只需要期末值，留在零就是一步直達到期。"

#: ../../engines.md:146 4f6998b2da3a4fe58912f9ce03d1f6ef
msgid ""
"The **control variate** is offered on an Asian alone, the one engine here"
" that takes it. Set anywhere else it would be refused, so the box stays "
"on screen only to be cleared."
msgstr "**控制變量**只在亞式選擇權上提供，這是這裡唯一接受它的引擎。設在其他地方會被拒絕，所以那個核取方塊只會留在畫面上讓你把它清掉。"

#: ../../engines.md:149 2ff3686f893246aa94aa857236996b6f
msgid ""
"Monte Carlo is not offered for every style, and where it is closed the "
"control says why. A cliquet is the sharpest case: QuantLib's only sampled"
" cliquet engine prices the **performance** form, so the ratchet takes "
"analytic and nothing else. A **basket** is the other direction — past two"
" assets, or on a weighted average, Monte Carlo is the only method left, "
"because the closed forms are two-asset and kind-specific."
msgstr ""
"並不是每一種類型都提供蒙地卡羅，關掉的地方控制項會說明原因。棘輪式是最明顯的例子：QuantLib "
"唯一的抽樣型棘輪引擎算的是**表現型**，所以棘輪型只能走解析解，別無其他。**一籃子**則是相反的方向——超過兩個資產，或是做加權平均時，蒙地卡羅是唯一還開著的方法，因為那些封閉解都是兩資產、而且綁定累加方式的。"

#: ../../engines.md:155 a62e750e4f384f7ea3b022956806f240
msgid ""
"Setting **progress every N paths** switches to the batched path. That is "
"what emits progress frames, what draws the convergence trace, and what "
"lets a cancel stop the work rather than only the waiting."
msgstr "設定**每 N 條路徑回報進度**會切換到分批路徑。那正是送出進度訊框、畫出收斂軌跡，並讓取消真正停下工作而不只是停下等待的東西。"

#: ../../engines.md:159 6daa23cd64514b6390d0168e3814869b
msgid ""
"The engine card with method Monte Carlo: seed 42, samples 100000, pseudo-"
"random rng, twelve time steps a year, and report progress every 20000 "
"paths, followed by a yellow note saying batching is what emits progress "
"and makes a cancel possible, and that it changes the price."
msgstr "方法選 Monte Carlo 時的引擎卡片：seed 42、samples 100000、pseudo-random 亂數、每年 12 個時間步，以及每 20000 條路徑回報一次進度；下面是一段黃色的提示，說分批是進度的來源、也是取消之所以可能的原因，而且它會改變價格。"

#: ../../engines.md:163 78f9fb0f4c1b4305a82029eddd65e445
msgid ""
"The whole block, batched. The warning is yellow rather than grey because "
"this is the one control on the card that changes the answer as well as "
"what you see while it runs — and the seed, the sample count and this "
"number all echo back on the result, so a price can be reproduced from "
"what it reports."
msgstr ""
"整個區塊，而且是分批的。這段警告用黃色而不是灰色，因為它是這張卡片上唯一一個既改變你在等待時看到的東西、也改變答案本身的控制項——而 "
"seed、樣本數與這個數字都會在結果裡回報，所以一個價格可以從它自己報出來的東西重現。"

#: ../../engines.md:169 ecc2c1135c0a433da435412790f767ba
msgid ""
"Batching **changes the answer**, because independent batches with derived"
" seeds draw from the random number stream differently from one run of the"
" same total. Measured on the reference trade: 9.288545 single-shot "
"against 9.307731 batched, same seed and same sample count, with the "
"analytic value at 9.297476. Neither is wrong; they are different "
"estimators. Reproducibility keys on the triple (seed, samples, batch "
"size), which is why the result echoes the whole engine block back."
msgstr ""
"分批**會改變答案**，因為以衍生種子跑的各批次，從亂數流中取值的方式與同樣總量的一次跑並不相同。在基準交易上實測：單次 9.288545 對分批"
" 9.307731，相同的種子與樣本數，而解析解值為 "
"9.297476。兩者都不錯；它們是不同的估計量。可重現性繫於（種子、樣本數、批次大小）這個三元組，這也是結果會把整個引擎區塊回音報出的原因。"

